Z||000003||MinnGreenGT||09-22-2001||12:09 AM||||I'm currently running a 3.1L V6 with no muffler, just baffle tips- and it's "wicked loud" Check out this older thread about the exhaust system and what others think of it...<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/013191.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/013191.html</A> <P>I'm not the first V6 with this setup, but I've never seen a 2.5 with it... then again- there's no better way to find out than to try!  Oh, and as an update to the other thread- I recieved my cutout pipe after Fierorama, but haven't had a chance to install it.<P>That's not a bad way to find out how it sounds... buy a Y-Cutout pipe ($22 JCWhitney or Local parts store) and weld it into place- then you can at least swich back and forth (cable included).<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole.gif">  <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
Z||000004||qwikgta||09-22-2001||01:12 AM||||Just get yourself a 2.5L header and put on a supertrapp like i did, it sounds great<P>Rob<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/my_engine4_1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/00supertrapp.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/taillights.jpg"> <P>#300  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
